  (text "Smart vent backpack for Seeed XIAO ESP32-C6 (generated by generate.py)" (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid dd031c83-1ae2-4d37-b28d-4456e1310263))
  (text "Q1 blocks a reversed cell. Servo power: TPS22917 cuts the cell off completely (nA leakage), MT3608 boosts to 5.1 V." (at 25.4 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 1004614d-b330-43c6-a6a2-89dd4c94d382))
  (text "Vout = 0.6 V x (1 + 51k/6.8k) = 5.1 V.  D3 (SRV_EN) also feeds the limit switch through R9." (at 25.4 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 0f515714-e80d-458d-8322-979f8440b52a))
  (text "Wire TP1/TP2 to the XIAO's BAT+/BAT- pads through the board's window." (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid e12f4ded-39b1-4291-bdd7-73966cd85fbb))
